English:
Restaurants must;
1.ensure quality & safety of food, rinse &sanitize food contact surfaces, disinfect surfaces, floors & counters.
2.Install adequate portable running water & accessible washing basins for hand washing purposes, at the entrance & exit points.

Kiswahili:
Migahawa lazima;
1.hakikisha ubora na usalama wa chakula, suuza na usafishe sehemu zinazogusa chakula, kuua viini kwenye nyuso, sakafu na kaunta.
2.Sakinisha maji ya bomba ya kutosha na beseni za kunawia zinazoweza kufikiwa kwa madhumuni ya kunawa mikono, kwenye lango la kuingilia na kutoka.
